# The apps XenithOS Desktop comes with (the xenithos-desktop-apps package). Brave and Mullvad VPN
# come from their makers' own package sources, which the xenithos-archive package sets up, so
# they update with everything else.

## The browser, and the VPN
brave-browser
mullvad-vpn

